@startuml
title One continuous demo - four happy-path workflows
start
partition "WF1 - Course and member preparation" {
  :Course A ready;
  :Member M profile and shared training goals ready;
}
partition "WF2 - Purchase and successful payment" {
  :Member M creates invoice I and displays code / QR;
  :Invoice I is PAID; M is BOOKED in A;
  :Receptionist opens the same invoice and receipt;
  :Member transfers the whole A enrollment to equivalent course A2;
  :A enrollment is CANCELLED; A2 enrollment is BOOKED;
}
partition "WF3 - Learning progress" {
  :Assigned coach records PRESENT and feedback in B within the authorized attendance window;
  :Member M reads the saved attendance and feedback;
}
partition "WF4 - Results, rating and management report" {
  :Coach publishes completed-course C summary;
  :Member M reads results and submits course rating;
  :Center Manager report for A / M includes invoice I;
}
stop
legend bottom
  One member M throughout the entire demonstration.
  A = next course; B = ongoing learning course; C = completed course.
  B and C history are prepared before the demo.
  WF2 shows code / QR, then success; exact payment is simulated off-screen.
endlegend
@enduml
